{#- Apps and products (REQ-011 as amended by A-01, A-02; plan D-07, D-14, D-15):
    one article.card.app.portfolio-entry per entry of src/_data/portfolio.json,
    in data order, on the balanced subgrid — theme caption | chip row | name |
    summary | action. The theme caption has its own track (not the chip row):
    the founder-confirmed private label fills a three-column card's width on
    its own, so the chip row holds only the status chip and stays one line.
    Copy comes from strings.portfolio.<key>; the status label from
    strings.portfolioStatus and the theme caption from strings.themes. The name
    is plain text in every card; the action row is the same element for every
    card: a.app-action to the entry's url (url set, the card gets app-linked
    and the only a[href]) — "Repository ↗" when the url is the public
    repository on github.com, "Website ↗" when it is the public page of a
    product whose repository is private (nivå since si-gyc4), so the card
    never calls a private repository open — or p.app-private with the private
    note (url null, no link at all). .portfolio-entry and .portfolio-name are
    the content gate's stable hooks. -#}
{%- set apps = strings[lang].apps -%}
<section id="apps" class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="apps-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ apps.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2 id="apps-title">{{ apps.heading }}</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">{{ apps.lead }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="app-grid">
      {%- for entry in portfolio %}
      {%- set copy = strings[lang].portfolio[entry.key] %}
      <article class="card app portfolio-entry reveal{% if entry.url %} app-linked{% endif %}">
        <p class="app-theme">{{ strings[lang].themes[entry.theme].title }}</p>
        <div class="app-top">
          <span class="chip chip-{{ entry.status }}"><span class="chip-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ strings[lang].portfolioStatus[entry.status] }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="app-name portfolio-name">{{ copy.name }}</h3>
        <p class="app-text">{{ copy.summary }}</p>
        {%- if entry.url %}
        <a class="app-action" href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ strings[lang].portfolio.repoLink if entry.url.startsWith("https://github.com/") else strings[lang].portfolio.siteLink }}<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        {%- else %}
        <p class="app-private">{{ strings[lang].portfolio.privateNote }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
